        { "gh:scene": "Governance Audit", "gh:prompt": "photorealistic, 8k. (Reika Kujoin: 45-year-old elegant woman) glaring at (Toru Sasaki: 34-year-old male). 'This exception is a crime.' Intense psychological pressure." },
        { "gh:scene": "Kaname's Wrench", "gh:prompt": "photorealistic, 8k. (Kaname: 18-year-old male) holding a chrome torque wrench. 'Your rules are ill-fitted.' Using it to 'tighten' a holographic server configuration." },
        { "gh:scene": "Knight of Rules", "gh:prompt": "photorealistic, 8k, surreal. A ghost knight in paper armor appearing in the sterile server room. It attacks with a spear of frozen regulations." },
